1. Format orders into batches (3-5)
   Open utility/order-splitter.js and paste your input string into it. In the console, the orders will be split into rows of 3.
   Run:
   node utility/order-splitter.js

I usually take those rows and add them to the 'to-run.txt' file in the utility directory.

2. Start Python server (see README in InvoiceFlow directory)
3. Add the orders to the 'run-me.sh' script on line 27, 'csv-string'.

4. Run:
   ./run-leads.sh

   or
   ./run-invoices.sh
